@program gtk3-text-input-test
@compositor kwin
# As wl-im-windows.keys, with KWin's input-method-v1 and window list:
# Each window has an input state of its own, as with fcitx5 (the
# compositor tells which window has the focus): Control+Space in the first
# window leaves a second one in Chinese, and the first one is still in
# English when it gets the focus back.
C-<space> x @check @exec gtk3-text-input-test:a:<space> y @check
